<title>POLAND: BRE Q2 net rises to PLN 43.12 mln.</title>
<headline>BRE Q2 net rises to PLN 43.12 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			52.67  vs    42.78</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  52.67  vs    42.78</p>
<p>    net profit				43.12  vs    33.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.56  vs     0.98</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    183.65  vs   112.67</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 117.49  vs    61.19</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    24.12  vs    15.51</p>
<p>    costs of commission	(profit)  0.70  vs     1.06</p>
<p>    income tax				 9.55  vs     9.16</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>						H1 1997     H1  1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			90.01  vs   100.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  90.02  vs   100.19</p>
<p>    net profit				68.33  vs    68.07</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.56  vs     0.98</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    336.09  vs   226.82</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 209.82  vs   120.54</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    45.46  vs    28.92</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    3.29  vs     1.78</p>
<p>    income tax				21.68  vs    32.12</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
